{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24793","headline":"奉和白太守拣橘 · 张彤","name":"奉和白太守拣橘","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凌霜远涉太湖深，双卷朱旗望橘林。\n树树笼烟疑带火，山山照日似悬金。\n行看采掇方盈手，暗觉馨香已满襟。\n拣选封题皆尽力，无人不感近臣心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张彤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24793.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24793","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}